a('steam-boiler-supply-erection',
 ['Size the boiler on real peak steam demand plus planned expansion, not on the old boiler\'s rating.','Confirm fuel availability and cost (gas, coal, biomass or furnace oil) before choosing the burner and furnace.','Plan the boiler room layout for safe access, blow-down and future maintenance.','Include feed water treatment in the project scope from day one.','Ask for performance testing at commissioning and keep the report.'],
 'Gas curtailment in winter and rising fuel prices push many Pakistani factories to review fuel choice when they replace a boiler. Selecting the right boiler type, fuel arrangement and feed water system at the start avoids years of high running costs.',
 [('Can Seamens install a boiler we have already bought?','Erection and piping can be scoped for an existing boiler after a site assessment.'),('Is water treatment included?','Feed water treatment can be included in the project scope.')],
 [('New textile processing unit','A new dyeing or finishing unit needs reliable steam sized for its machines. A correctly sized fire-tube boiler with proper piping supports production from the first day.'),
  ('Replacing an old, inefficient boiler','Old boilers often waste fuel. Replacement with a correctly sized unit and good water treatment lowers fuel cost.'),
  ('Thermic fluid for high-temperature processes','Stenters and some chemical processes need high temperatures without high pressure; thermic fluid heaters serve them.')])
a('boiler-upgrades-maintenance',
 ['Schedule the annual overhaul during a planned shutdown.','Keep records of every inspection.','Tune burners after any fuel change.','Measure flue gas for efficiency.','Replace failing tubes before they leak.'],
 'Many boilers in Pakistani factories are decades old and run long hours. A disciplined maintenance and tuning programme keeps them safe and efficient.',
 [('What does an efficiency audit include?','Flue gas analysis, heat loss review and recommendations.'),('Can burners be converted to another fuel?','Fuel conversion is assessed case by case.')],
 [('Annual statutory inspection prep','Overhauling before inspection helps the boiler pass first time.'),
  ('High fuel bills','Burner tuning and audits find savings.'),
  ('Tube leaks','Inspection and replacement prevent unplanned stops.')])
a('captive-power-plant-support',
 ['Monitor feed water and steam purity closely.','Control cooling water cycles.','Inspect turbines for deposits during outages.','Keep chemical dosing automated.','Review trends monthly.'],
 'Pakistani industries run captive power plants to manage grid reliability and cost. Water chemistry keeps these plants available.',
 [('Do you support co-generation plants?','Yes, IPPs and co-generation plants are in scope.'),('Why do turbine deposits form?','Impurities carried with steam can deposit on turbine blades.')],
 [('Textile mill captive plants','Mills depend on captive power; water treatment protects availability.'),
  ('Sugar mill co-generation','Co-generation boilers need careful feed water control.'),
  ('Independent power producers','Water chemistry supports reliable output.')])
