 ['Calibrate sensors regularly.','Set alarm limits.','Check dosing pumps weekly.','Review data trends.','Train operators.'],
 'Labour turnover in Pakistani plants makes manual dosing inconsistent. Automatic dosing and online monitoring keep treatment steady across shifts.',
